                <invention-title lang="de">SCHAUFEL MIT CHEVRON-FLÄCHE</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">AUBE AVEC FACE EN CHEVRONS</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">VANE WITH CHEVRON FACE</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A gas turbine engine component includes a vane arc segment (60) that defines an axis. The vane arc segment (60) includes an airfoil section (68) and first and second platforms (64, 66). The airfoil section (68) has a first radial end (68e), a second radial end (68f), a first side (68c), a second side (68d), a leading edge (68a), and a trailing edge (68b). The airfoil section (68) has associated characteristics, including a center of pressure (P) and an aerodynamic load vector (ALV) through the center of pressure (P). The first platform (64) defines a first side chevron face (64c) that has a leading leg (70) and a trailing leg (72) that meet at an angle. The leading leg (70) is elongated along a centerline (70b) that is non-axially oriented with respect to the axis (A), the leading leg (70) meets the leading face (64a) at a leading first side corner (74a). The leading first side corner (74a) is located outside of the aerodynamic load vector (ALV) relative to the leading edge (68a) of the airfoil section (68).</p>
            </abstract>
